{{Game-Tabs|pd2=Patterns|pd3=Patterns (Payday 3)}}
A '''pattern''' is an item for customizing [[Masks (Payday 2)|masks]] in ''[[PAYDAY 2]]''. Patterns without cost will be returned to your stash upon selling or storing the mask they've been used on. A pattern that is not part of a promotional bonus or achievement can only be obtained from card drops.

'''How colour is applied to the pattern:'''

* Dark gray is the primary color.
* Light gray is the secondary color.
* White parts are white, or if you chose a [[Materials|material]], it will be that material.
* Blue parts are transparent and therefore display what the unaltered mask looks like in those areas.
'''How patterns are divided in this wiki:'''

*{{Color|#0060ff|Blue}} items are unlocked by default.
* '''White''' items are unlocked through card drops and are considered normal
*{{Color|dlc|Yellow}} items are from a DLC.
* {{Color|event|Orange}} items are from a special event.
* {{Color|infamous|Fuchsia}} items are "Infamous" (rare) items.


Below is a list of all patterns, however this wiki page needs updating as it is missing some.

