|-|Trivia=
* '''Aperture Science''', '''Companion Cube''', '''Piece of Cake''' and '''Portal''' are references to the ''[[wikipedia:Portal (series)|Portal]]'' series.
* '''Barbarian War Paint''' Is based on the face paint put on by Conan (Schwarzenegger) in "[[wikipedia:Conan the Barbarian (1982 film)|Conan the Barbarian]]" when preparing for the final battle with Thulsa Doom (James Earl Jones).
* '''Fleur De Lis''' and '''Golden Lily''' are both references to the use of the fleur de lis icon in the [[PAYDAY Secret ARG|Secret ARG]]. The image also appeared on [[Hoxton|Hoxton's]] [[Masks#Secret|Secret mask]]. Their specific meaning is disputed. 
* '''God is my Judge''' is Daniel's headband from the Karate Kid. "Daniel" is a Hebrew name meaning "God is my judge".
* '''Happy Clown''' is based on [[Hoxton]]'s mask design.
* '''One Nation Under God''' is based on [[Dallas]]' mask design. The name refers to the 1954 modification of the American [[wikipedia:Pledge of Allegiance|Pledge of Allegiance]].
* '''Marvellous Blocks''' is a reference to the character Marv from ''[[wikipedia:Sin City|Sin City]]''.
* '''Masked Falcon''' and '''Mexican Wrestler''' are references to [[wikipedia:WWE|WWE]] wrestlers [[wikipedia:Místico|Sin Cara]] and [[wikipedia:Rey Mysterio|Rey Mysterio]].
* '''Nautical Compass''' is a reference to the [[PAYDAY Secret ARG|Secret ARG]]. A compass on a map and on a rug in [[Counterfeit]] were clues in the puzzle.
* '''Ozymandias''' is a reference to the comic "[[wikipedia:Watchmen|Watchmen]]", which has a character named "[[wikipedia:Ozymandias (comics)|Ozymandias]]". The name originates from a sonnet written in 1818 by [[wikipedia:Percy Bysshe Shelley|Percy Bysshe Shelley]], bearing the name as title.
* '''Sign Of Annihilation''' is a reference to [[wikipedia:Akuma (Street Fighter)|Akuma]] from the [[wikipedia:Street Fighter|Street Fighter]] Franchise.
* '''The Flag''' and '''Three Crowns''' are respectively references to the national emblem and flag of Sweden, home of Overkill.
* '''The Hypnotica''' depicts the painting "Blaze" by [[wikipedia:Bridget Riley|Bridget Riley]].
* '''The Ouroboros''' and '''The Head of the Ouroboros''' is based on the ancient Greek [[wikipedia:Ouroboros|symbol of the same name]].
* '''The TF2''' is a reference to Valve's video game ''[[wikipedia:Team Fortress 2|Team Fortress 2]]'', showing its iconic logo.
* '''Violent Bite''' appears to be a Xenomorph jawline with the teeth shape and 4 teeth inbetween the pointed canine teeth on top and bottom jaw, just missing the trademark inner-jaw. The lightly shaded areas below and above the teeth could possibly be saliva which alot is common to be dripping from a xeno jaw before a bite.
* '''[[wikipedia:Yggdrasil|Yggdrasil]]''' is the [[wikipedia:Tree of life|Tree of life]] from [[wikipedia:Norse mythology|Norse mythology]]. In the ''PAYDAY'' series, it previously appeared in the [[PAYDAY Secret ARG|Secret ARG]] and [[Chains|Chains's]] [[Masks#Secret|Secret mask]].
</tabber>

