* '''Good ol' Al''' is the pattern on the mask of superhero [[wikipedia:Spawn (comics)|Spawn]], whose real name is Al Simmons.
* '''Masked Mastermind''' is a reference to former WWE wrestler, [[wikipedia:The Ultimate Warrior|The Ultimate Warrior]].
* '''The Protagonist''' is a reference to the comic "[[wikipedia:Watchmen|Watchmen]]", where the protagonist [[wikipedia:Rorschach (comics)|Rorschach]] dons this pattern on his mask.
</tabber>
